      "name": "MA — Massachusetts State Building Code provides a shared, common code for all…",
      "proposal": "Massachusetts State Building Code provides a shared, common code for all buildings in MA, including with respect to flood-resistant design and construction. Periodically updated, with 10th MSBC effective as of October 2024. There are additional optional extensions for energy which municipalities may adopt. (Stage: Respond, Prepare; Level of commitment: Regulation; Scope: State; Funding: Fully funded by State; Status: Completed.)",
